{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2178","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Flatten or Concatenate"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"3 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This is an interactive problem."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"While procrastinating at work, Dilhan the elf stumbled upon two arrays $$$a$$$ and $$$b$$$. Initially, both of them consist of a single integer $$$2^k$$$ (i.e., $$$a=b=[2^k]$$$), where $$$k$$$ is a non-negative integer."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Dilhan then applied the following two types of operations an arbitrary number of times (possibly zero), in any order: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Flatten — Choose either $$$a$$$ or $$$b$$$, and select "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"any"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" element $$$x$$$ that is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"maximal"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" within that array ($$$x$$$ does "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"not"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" need to be maximal in the other array). Then, replace $$$x$$$ with two copies of $$$\\frac x2$$$ in the same position. This operation can only be applied if $$$x$$$ is even. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Concatenate — Set "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"both"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a$$$ and $$$b$$$ to be $$$a+b$$$, where $$$+$$$ denotes array concatenation. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After performing these operations, Dilhan discards $$$b$$$, hides $$$a$$$ from you, and challenges you to a game."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let $$$n$$$ be the length of the hidden array $$$a$$$. You may make the following query: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Choose an interval $$$[l, r]$$$ ($$$1\\le l\\le r\\le n$$$), and Dilhan will tell you the sum $$$a_l+a_{l+1}+\\cdots+a_r$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Determine the value of the maximum element of $$$a$$$ by making at most $$$300$$$ queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test contains multiple test cases. The first line contains the number of test cases $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 100$$$). The description of the test cases follows. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 10^5$$$) — the length of $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that $$$1\\le a_i\\le 2^{30}$$$, and the array $$$a$$$ can be generated by the process described in the statements."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$10^5$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"custom","title":"Interaction"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Interaction"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, you are first given an integer $$$n$$$ — the length of the hidden array $$$a$$$. You may then make up to $$$300$$$ queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"To make a query, print a line in the following format:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\texttt{?}\\;l\\;r$$$ ($$$1\\le l\\le r\\le n$$$) — the indices chosen for the query. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After you print a query, the interactor will respond with a single integer — the sum $$$a_l+a_{l+1}+\\ldots+a_r$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"To report that you have determined the value of the maximum element of $$$a$$$, print your answer in the following format:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\texttt{!}\\; m$$$ ($$$1\\le m\\le 2^{30}$$$) — the value of the maximum element. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Printing the answer does not count as one of the $$$300$$$ queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After printing the answer, proceed to the next test case. If the current test case is the last one, terminate the program."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After printing each query do not forget to output the end of line and flush$$$^{\\text{∗}}$$$ the output. Otherwise, you will get "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Idleness limit exceeded"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" verdict."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If, at any interaction step, you read $$$-1$$$ instead of valid data, your solution must exit immediately. This means that your solution will receive "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Wrong answer"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" because of an invalid query or any other mistake. Failing to exit can result in an arbitrary verdict because your solution will continue to read from a closed stream. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The interactor in this problem is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"not"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" adaptive. In other words, the array $$$a$$$ is fixed before any queries and will not change during the interaction."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Hacks are disabled in this problem."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$^{\\text{∗}}$$$To flush, use: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"fflush(stdout)"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"cout.flush()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in C++; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"sys.stdout.flush()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in Python; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" see the documentation for other languages. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n11\n\n9\n\n4\n\n12\n\n1\n\n1\n\n8\n\n4\n\n4\n\n4\n\n4\n\n8\n\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n\n\n? 3 8\n\n? 1 4\n\n? 5 11\n\n! 2\n\n? 1 1\n\n! 1\n\n? 1 1\n\n? 2 2\n\n? 3 3\n\n? 4 4\n\n! 4\n\n! 1073741824"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, Dilhan's hidden array $$$a$$$ is $$$[1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2]$$$. It can be generated by the following process:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"#"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Type"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$a$$$ after operation"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$b$$$ after operation"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$[4]$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$[4]$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Flatten $$$a$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$[\\underline 4] \\to {[2, 2]}$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$[4]$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Flatten $$$b$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$[2, 2]$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$[\\underline 4] \\to {[2, 2]}$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"3"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Flatten $$$a$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$[2, \\underline 2] \\to {[2, 1, 1]}$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$[2, 2]$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"4"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Concatenate"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$[2, 1, 1, 2, 2]$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$[2, 1, 1, 2, 2]$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"5"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Flatten $$$a$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$[\\underline 2, 1, 1, 2, 2]\\to {[1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 2]}$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$[2, 1, 1, 2, 2]$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"6"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Concatenate"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$[1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2]$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$[1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2]$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"}],"kind":"table_body"}],"kind":"table"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" For the query $$$\\mathtt{?\\;3\\;8}$$$, the jury responded with $$$1+1+2+2+2+1=9$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" For the query $$$\\mathtt{?\\;1\\;4}$$$, the jury responded with $$$1+1+1+1=4$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" For the query $$$\\mathtt{?\\;5\\;11}$$$, the jury responded with $$$2+2+2+1+1+2+2=12$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"And the value of the maximum element of $$$a$$$ is $$$2$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case, the array $$$a$$$ has only one element. By the query, the value of the only element is $$$1$$$, and it must also be the maximum value."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third test case, Dilhan's hidden array $$$a$$$ is $$$[4, 4, 4, 4, 4, 4, 4, 4]$$$. It can be generated by the following process:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"#"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Type"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$a$$$ after operation"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$b$$$ after operation"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$[4]$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$[4]$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Concatenate"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$[4, 4]$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$[4, 4]$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Concatenate"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$[4, 4, 4, 4]$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$[4, 4, 4, 4]$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"3"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Concatenate"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$[4, 4, 4, 4, 4, 4, 4, 4]$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$[4, 4, 4, 4, 4, 4, 4, 4]$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"}],"kind":"table_body"}],"kind":"table"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"And the value of the maximum element of $$$a$$$ is $$$4$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the fourth test case, Dilhan's hidden array $$$a$$$ is $$$[2^{29}, 2^{29}, 2^{30}, 2^{29}, 2^{28}, 2^{28}, 2^{29}, 2^{29}]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"2178E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2178/problem/E"}